# Azure Deployment Plan for Scene Solver Project

## **Goal**
Deploy the Scene Solver AI-powered crime scene analysis application to Azure using Azure CLI and Bicep IaC templates.

## **Project Information**
**Scene Solver**  
- **Stack**: Multi-service application (React Frontend, Node.js Backend, Python AI Service)
  - Frontend: React 18 + Axios + React Router
  - Backend: Node.js + Express + MongoDB + JWT Auth
  - AI Service: Python + Flask + PyTorch + YOLOv8 + CLIP + BLIP
- **Type**: Full-stack AI-powered crime scene analysis platform with file uploads, authentication, history tracking
- **Containerization**: Python AI service has Dockerfile; Node.js and React need containerization
- **Key Features**: Object detection, caption generation, scene classification, text-to-speech, trash management
- **Hosting**: Azure App Service (Frontend & Backend), Azure Container Apps (AI Service), Azure Cosmos DB (MongoDB)

